     A                                      REF(SCREFP)
     A          R PKT01                     TEXT('KEY TYPE RECORD')
     A            KTKTYP    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('KEY' 'TYPE')
     A            KTPNAM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM NAME')
